WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.9 · Theory of Change
Test, write and use your Theory of Change

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Your Theory of Change is useful when people can read it, question it and decide with it.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Write a one-page narrative in plain language.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Test it with a sceptic before you launch.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Date it as version 0.1 and plan its review.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write your test plan, version and review dates.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
